<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 1.886 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 1.886 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all three auctions whereby it sought to drain 1.886 billion pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    840 million    16 days  24.13 pct</p>
<p>    840 million    15 days  24.05 pct</p>
<p>    206 million     1 day   24.01 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
